  "body": "## SCAN v0.28 RC1\n\nThis PR is now **feature-frozen and release-candidate ready for review**. No new scanner features, extraction capabilities, reconstruction mechanisms, or refinement behavior are in scope before release.\n\n## Sealed package\n\n- Engine: `0.28.0`\n- Package manifest: **90/90 verified**\n- Manifest SHA-256: `a03048a4bc54e346313f5bd32e9fb5281ee5686a18e98bd55fcc0009ebfd861e`\n- Regression suite: **158 passed, 0 failed**\n- LLM-disabled qualification: **PASS**\n- Required release queries: **12/12 PASS**\n- Integrity errors: **0**\n- Fresh Python 3.13 wheel install: **PASS**\n\n## Reproducible artifacts\n\n- wheel: `87fe51d3241d3b21627261bdb7db3ab5ad4bd69ac0b6a9de5d4fa9ccbb78aa79`\n  - two independent builds are byte-identical with `SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=315532800`\n- sdist: `43fb8f46a1943a77cb55e73ac469049cdd408f28ec104ece3d2f89f65a17bd70`\n- deterministic source ZIP: `6e7d4553a07d843689ae9589b304765eea61b1cf265bebd45cc1e971e39fc9f0`\n\n## Frozen calibration\n\nFrozen v0.27\u2192v0.28 calibration: **PASS / deterministic PASS**.\n\n- NotepadNext: 380 \u2192 380 actionable human surfaces\n- Moji: 103 \u2192 103 actionable human surfaces\n- new actionable static-web surfaces: **0**\n- existing surface/effect states preserved\n- NEST projection preserved\n- integrity errors: **0**\n\nThe successful frozen calibration ran at commit `4c16827fffc64b837bec2d1b781cf6aca39e6b7c`. Git comparison from that commit to the sealed package shows **no changes under `scan/`**. The only later additions inside `engine/v0.28` were the refinement regression test and `PACKAGE_MANIFEST.json`.\n\n## Release evidence\n\nSealed records are committed under `Anchor/releases/v0.28/`:\n\n- `PACKAGE_MANIFEST.json`\n- `QUALIFICATION.json`\n- `FROZEN_CALIBRATION.json`\n- `FROZEN_CANDIDATE_RECEIPT.json`\n- `SCAN_v0.28_RC1_REPORT.md`\n\n## Remaining release-management step\n\nThis PR does **not** claim that v0.28 has been merged, tagged, or published as a GitHub Release. RC1 is ready for review; merge/tag/publication are the next explicit release-management actions.\n",
